<title>UK: RJB Mining down as BZW cuts estimates.</title>
<headline>RJB Mining down as BZW cuts estimates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in RJB Mining Plc plummeted on Tuesday as analysts at its brokerage BZW lowered earnings estimates on the stock because of weaker-than-expected coal prices, market sources said.</p>
<p>For 1996 BZW cut its estimate for pre-tax profit to 185 million stg from 190 million and for 1997 to cut to 190 million stg from 232 million, sources said.</p>
<p>The stock was down 90p at 395 by 0939 GMT. Analysts at BZW declined comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
